<ZONE 12>

<VIRTUAL 04>
<NAME> Floating Slab </NAME>
<DESC>
You appear to be in the middle of a floating slab of smooth,
flat rock. You feel cold winds blow into your face and watch clouds move
slowly overhead. Down below, partially covered by clouds, is a reasonably
large city; many peasants can be seen wandering in its streets.
</DESC>
<BIT> NOMOB GODROOM </BIT>
<TYPE> INSIDE </TYPE>
<DIR D>
	<LINK> 1000 </LINK>
	<DESC> You see a statue of some important figure below you. </DESC>
	<KEYWORDS> NONE </KEYWORDS>
	<DOORFLAG> NONE </DOORFLAG> 
	<KEYNUM> NONE </KEYNUM>
</DIR>
<DIR U>
	<LINK> 1001 </LINK>
	<DESC> The sky goes higher and higher. </DESC>
	<KEYWORDS> NONE </KEYWORDS>
	<DOORFLAG> NONE </DOORFLAG>
	<KEYNUM> NONE </KEYNUM>
</DIR>
<EXTRA 0>
	<KEYWORDS> sky cloud clouds </KEYWORDS>
	<DESC> The sky swirls with beautiful clouds. </DESC>
</EXTRA>
<EXTRA 1>
	<KEYWORDS> ground </KEYWORDS>
	<DESC> The ground is pretty clean. </DESC>
</EXTRA>
</VIRTUAL>

